  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN244.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">viṉaimuṟṟiya talaimakaṉ ṟērppākaṟkuc colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What HE who had finished [his] work said to the charioteer.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN244.1">
        <l>pacaipaṭu paccai neytōṟ ṟoḻin<supplied>ta</supplied>ṉṉa</l>
        <l>cēyuyar ciṉaiya mācciṟaip paṟavai</l>
        <l>pakaluṟai mutumaram pulampap pōki</l>
        <l>mukaivāy tiṟanta nakaivāy mullai</l>
        <l>kaṭimaka<supplied>ḷ</supplied> katuppi ṉāṟik koṭimicai</l>
        <l>vaṇṭiṉan tavirkkun taṇpatak kālai</l>
        <l>variṉum vārā rāyiṉu māṇṭavark</l>
        <l>kiṉitukol vāḻi tōḻi yeṉattaṉ</l>
        <l>pallitaḻ maḻaikka ṇallakañ civappa</l>
        <l>varuntuva ḷavaḷeṉa virumpip</l>
        <l>pāṇaṉ vantaṉaṉ ṟūtē nīyum<anchor n="1"/></l>
        <l>pullār puravi <supplied>va</supplied>lviraintu pūṭṭi</l>
        <l>neṭuntē rūrmati valava</l>
        <l>muṭintaṉ ṟammanā muṉṉiya <supplied>vi</supplied>ṉaiyē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="6">At the proper time of coolness, when the group of bees stop</l>
        <l corresp="5">on the creepers, being fragrant like the hair of protected(?) women,</l>
        <l corresp="4">of jasmine, smiling mouths on which the buds have opened up,</l>
        <l corresp="2">while the birds with dark wings of the far upper branches</l>
        <l corresp="1">– that are like paste-smeared hides that are put in oil –</l>
        <l corresp="3">have gone, for the old tree, where they stay at daytime, to be lonely,</l>
        <l corresp="11a-c">the bard has come as a messenger,</l>
        <l corresp="10">longingly(?), to say “she suffers,</l>
        <l corresp="9">so that the good interior of her rain eyes with many lashes turns red,</l>
        <l corresp="7">saying ‘whether he comes [or] whether he does not come,</l>
        <l corresp="8">[is] it pleasing for him there, oh friend?’.”</l>
        <l rend="indent6" corresp="11d">And you,</l>
        <l corresp="13">mount the tall chariot, charioteer,</l>
        <l corresp="12">very speedily fastening the grass-eating horses.</l>
        <l corresp="14">Finished is, alas, the work we undertook.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

